@LibraryTraining.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5199

### 蔵書一覧：200、5冊、available 3冊 / onLoan 2冊
GET {{LibraryTraining.Api_HostAddress}}/book-copies
Accept: application/json

### 未対応のクエリ：400、code=unsupported_query
GET {{LibraryTraining.Api_HostAddress}}/book-copies?availability=available
Accept: application/problem+json

### テンプレートの天気予報：200、5件
GET {{LibraryTraining.Api_HostAddress}}/WeatherForecast
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI（Development環境）
GET {{LibraryTraining.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json